/-! # A table of the preferred masks of all short labels

`identMaskLookup j` reads the preferred mask of the flat short label `j < 98280` from a literal
table of `1536` chunks of `64` masks (24-bit fields), selected by a balanced binary tree of
comparisons, so that one lookup touches a single small chunk.  The table is certified against
`shortMaskF` in the modules `GeneratedAxisGlobalIdentShortMaskTab0` to `...Tab3`. -/

@[expose] public noncomputable section
namespace FormalizedTextbooks.FrenkelLepowskyMeurmanMonster
namespace GeneratedAxisGlobalIdent

